{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/ff655090d5511fdb8b5667f0fd912260.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As One We Survive</strong> is a <strong>top-down survival game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> America. Step into the shoes of a father as he tries to find help for his sick daughter during a grid down post-pandemic event. <strong>Fight, scavenge, craft, and gather resources</strong> for your family's survival.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a <strong>unique blend of survival and colony management mechanics</strong>, you will have to form a community both to survive and find help for your daughter. <strong>Build and manage your community</strong>, protect your people from danger, and make tough decisions that will determine the fate of your group in a harsh and unforgiving world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.poster.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.webm?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.mp4?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Survival:</strong> Scavenge, craft, and outsmart the harsh wilderness in a dangerous world with scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Combat:</strong> No health packs; use bandages to stop bleeding, sleep to heal injuries, and maintain weapons for reliability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Management:</strong> Join a survivor community, upgrade your base with  facilities, and create renewable resources to support your people.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Companions</strong>: Form bonds with fellow survivors while scavenging for vital supplies and getting to know your community.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Progression:</strong> Hone survival skills in the wilderness, improve with every challenge, and master the art of survival.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes Of Play:</strong> Story and Survival. Experience a narrative in Story mode, then test your skills in the post-apocalyptic world alone or with a companion. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.poster.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.webm?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.mp4?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/8600ab9d0b28be5752ea4fde52a9f86b.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Form a Community:</strong> Recruit survivors to create a safe haven.<br><br><strong>Supply Runs:</strong> Gather food, water, and medicine for survival. <br><br><strong>Building and Resources:</strong> Construct facilities, create renewable resources. <br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Uncover Missions:</strong> Get intel from recruits, advance the story to help your daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.poster.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.webm?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.mp4?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2387670?t=1765958772","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765958772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765958772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765958772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/9fcdb094e82cb1ac91ce67a0d3c2c094.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/ff655090d5511fdb8b5667f0fd912260.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As One We Survive</strong> is a <strong>top-down survival game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> America. Step into the shoes of a father as he tries to find help for his sick daughter during a grid down post-pandemic event. <strong>Fight, scavenge, craft, and gather resources</strong> for your family's survival.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a <strong>unique blend of survival and colony management mechanics</strong>, you will have to form a community both to survive and find help for your daughter. <strong>Build and manage your community</strong>, protect your people from danger, and make tough decisions that will determine the fate of your group in a harsh and unforgiving world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.poster.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.webm?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.mp4?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Survival:</strong> Scavenge, craft, and outsmart the harsh wilderness in a dangerous world with scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Combat:</strong> No health packs; use bandages to stop bleeding, sleep to heal injuries, and maintain weapons for reliability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Management:</strong> Join a survivor community, upgrade your base with  facilities, and create renewable resources to support your people.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Companions</strong>: Form bonds with fellow survivors while scavenging for vital supplies and getting to know your community.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Progression:</strong> Hone survival skills in the wilderness, improve with every challenge, and master the art of survival.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes Of Play:</strong> Story and Survival. Experience a narrative in Story mode, then test your skills in the post-apocalyptic world alone or with a companion. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.poster.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.webm?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.mp4?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/8600ab9d0b28be5752ea4fde52a9f86b.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Form a Community:</strong> Recruit survivors to create a safe haven.<br><br><strong>Supply Runs:</strong> Gather food, water, and medicine for survival. <br><br><strong>Building and Resources:</strong> Construct facilities, create renewable resources. <br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Uncover Missions:</strong> Get intel from recruits, advance the story to help your daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.poster.avif?t=1765958772\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.webm?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.mp4?t=1765958772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Revelation Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/header.jpg?t=1765958772","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2023 Revelation Games LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2387670/804550/0b0977df29bc8a7383e04c992383e53fdad966e0/1750914020/dash_av1.mpd?t=1735183723","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2387670/804550/0b0977df29bc8a7383e04c992383e53fdad966e0/1750914020/dash_h264.mpd?t=1735183723","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2387670/804550/0b0977df29bc8a7383e04c992383e53fdad966e0/1750914020/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=173